      "basis_note": "D-045 and D-064 are Confirmed Category B design decisions under D-014. Their documented scope is economic arithmetic as recorded in the B-04 register (whole resources, whole crowns, integer basis points, explicit floor or ceil). The rule is not inherited by other registers; each register states its own precision convention in B-14 sections 8.1-8.2. B-09 F-AL-006 within-turn cumulative accrual and cross-turn remainder persistence are distinct concepts and are not governed or rejected by this authority record."
